Complete the memoization function:

```dart
Function memoize(%order% %order%) {
  %order%<dynamic, dynamic> cache = {};
  return (arg) {
    if (cache.containsKey(arg)) {
      return cache[arg];
    }
    var result = func(arg);
    cache[arg] = result;
    return result;
  };
}
```

